  "executive_briefing": "July 2026 marks a pivotal transition as the Digital Asset Market CLARITY Act nears a critical Senate floor vote, setting the stage for Bitcoin to evolve from a treasury-only asset into a robust settlement layer for smart contracts. This legislative milestone is catalyzing a shift in DeFi infrastructure, with market participants increasingly favoring native, non-custodial cross-chain liquidity protocols over traditional bridge models. While Ethereum remains the dominant engine for decentralized computation, Bitcoin-native L2s are gaining significant structural momentum, leveraging the impending regulatory framework to challenge Ethereum\u2019s hegemony in high-security settlement applications. Institutional Bitcoin adoption, matured through continuous ETF inflows, continues to serve as the industry's bedrock, reinforcing the long-term trend of institutional-grade market integration.",
